# Keep image small — exclude everything we don't need at runtime.
**/.git
**/.github
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.llm_cache
**/chroma_db
**/uvicorn.log
**/frontend.log
**/.env
**/.env.local

# Frontend is deployed separately on Vercel
frontend/

# Docs and metadata are not needed at runtime
docs/
README.md
LICENSE
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
